resolution "pass 232's open question, answered" {
  question "which recorded Tier-E cells were scored by compute_conformance_template.py, the host whose golden was an fp32 proxy"
  answer "none that say so. Of the 75 complete-chain comments in issue #199, ZERO name that host. Sixteen name a host at all -- 12 name corona_decode_host_ax7203.py -- and the other 59 name none"
