  and_the_check_on_it "tekum appears in ZERO of the 75 complete-chain Tier-E comments. The takum cells that do exist name corona-decode-takum16-bitstream, a BRAM-LUT decode, not this module. Nothing claims it -- the same shape as every RTL defect found since pass 237"
}

